# Not part of the Rails image. These are the largest and most frequently
# touched trees in the repo, and because `COPY . .` precedes assets:precompile,
# a change to any of them used to invalidate the bundle and asset layers -- an
# Android version bump or a cloudbuild.yaml edit would rebuild the whole app.
# Verified unreferenced from app/, config/, lib/, db/ and bin/ at runtime:
# the only apparent hits were an /android/ user-agent regex in application.js
# and comments citing docs/design/design-tokens.json.
android
docs
test
inapp-1.0.0
prototypes
design
scripts
.github
cloudbuild.yaml
